{"id":"maravilha","lemma":"maravilha","pos":"noun","rank":1713,"glosses":["wonder; marvel (something that causes amazement or awe)","daisy (Bellis perennis, a wild flower with a yellow head and white petals)","four o’clock flower (Mirabilis jalapa)"],"ipa":"/mɐ.ɾɐˈvi.ʎɐ/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"maravilhas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a6/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-MedK1-maravilha.wav","examples":[{"text":"A medicina fez maravilhas.","en":"The medicine worked marvels.","words":[{"g":"the / to"},{"g":"medicine"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},null]},{"text":"Comida fresca é uma maravilha.","en":"Fresh food is wonderful.","words":[{"g":"food, something edible"},{"g":"fresh","l":"fresco"},{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null]},{"text":"Que maravilha!","en":"Wonderful!","words":[{"g":"that / what"},null]},{"text":"O Taj Mahal é uma das sete maravilhas do mundo.","en":"The Taj Mahal is one of the seven wonders of the world.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,null,{"g":"is","l":"ser"},{"g":"a","l":"um"},null,{"g":"seven"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[8,10,"non-religious"]]}]}